sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Client
    participant BFF as BFF Server<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Registry as model-registry<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant Catalog as model-catalog-server<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant CatalogDB as PostgreSQL<br/>5432/TCP
    participant Controller as Manager Controller<br/>8081/TCP Health
    participant KServe as KServe InferenceService
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over BFF: REST API at /api/v1/<br/>50+ route registrations

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over User,Registry: Model Registry CRUD Flow
        User->>BFF: POST /api/v1/{namespace}/model_registry<br/>Bearer Token
        BFF->>K8sAPI: SubjectAccessReview<br/>SAR Check (SA credentials)
        K8sAPI-->>BFF: Authorized
        BFF->>Registry: Proxy Request<br/>Custom CA bundle (optional)
        Registry-->>BFF: Model Metadata
        BFF-->>User: JSON Response
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 230)
        Note over User,CatalogDB: Model Catalog Browsing Flow
        User->>BFF: GET /api/v1/model_catalog/items<br/>Bearer Token
        BFF->>K8sAPI: SelfSubjectAccessReview<br/>Token-based AuthZ
        K8sAPI-->>BFF: Authorized
        BFF->>Catalog: Proxy Request
        Catalog->>CatalogDB: SQL Query
        CatalogDB-->>Catalog: Results
        Catalog-->>BFF: Catalog Items
        BFF-->>User: JSON Response
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 230)
        Note over User,S3: Model Transfer Job Flow
        User->>BFF: POST /api/v1/{namespace}/model_registry/.../transfer
        BFF->>K8sAPI: SAR Check
        K8sAPI-->>BFF: Authorized
        BFF->>K8sAPI: Create batch/v1/Job
        K8sAPI-->>BFF: Job Created
        Note over K8sAPI,S3: Job uploads model to S3/OCI
        BFF-->>User: Transfer Job Status
    end

    rect rgb(245, 235, 255)
        Note over Controller,KServe: InferenceService Reconciliation
        KServe-->>Controller: Watch Event<br/>InferenceService CR
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Get Service<br/>List Services
        K8sAPI-->>Controller: Service Details
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Reconcile Resources
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over User,K8sAPI: Identity & Namespace Resolution
        User->>BFF: Any API Request
        Note over BFF: InjectRequestIdentity<br/>extracts user identity
        Note over BFF: AttachNamespace<br/>resolves target namespace
        BFF->>K8sAPI: ClusterRoleBinding check<br/>(cluster-admin detection)
        K8sAPI-->>BFF: RBAC Result
        Note over BFF: 10-worker parallel SAR pool<br/>for namespace enumeration
    end
